#X obj 230 78 cnv 1 535 185 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -237178 -1 0;
#X text 240 83 the object performs run-length encoding: it compresses
consecutive repeated elements into a list of unique elements and a
parallel list of repeat counts;
#X text 240 138 the first outlet outputs the list of unique elements
\, the second outlet outputs the corresponding repeat counts;
#X text 240 193 the object can be used to compress a list with many
repeated values \, for example to shorten a long sequence of identical
notes before transmitting or storing it;
